{"ID":"20230926144943-gj2r683","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926144943-gj2r683","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144943-gj2r683\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144947-xqlqxb3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144947-zqaural\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144947-zqaural\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"【百合滑石散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926144947"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926144947-xqlqxb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926144947-xqlqxb3","updated":"20230926144947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：百合一两（炙）、滑石二两"}]},{"ID":"20230926144947-s4y81h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926144947-s4y81h3","updated":"20230926144947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右二味，为散，饮服方寸匙，日三服。当微利，热除则止后服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926144947-zqaural","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926144947-zqaural","updated":"20230926144947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【13.7】百合病变发热者，百合滑石散主之。"}]}]}